Since it seems that you don’t actually hold the key to her heart, you can at least try to convince her of your innocence before she leaves forever. So here’s a list of reasons that she might be wrong about the situation:

- She’s probably too young and doesn’t quite understand her emotions yet (or perhaps your arguments upset her more than they should);
- She could be in denial over something else going on (possibly with other people) and isn’t seeing things the way they are;
